      <p>第二，培养「指挥力」而非「执行力」... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
      <p>第三，守住「判断力」这个底线... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
      <h2>半百视角... [Content continues in Chinese]</h2>
      <p>我50岁了，按传统标准，我的「知识储备」早就过时了... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
